  "title": "Quest for the Spirit Blade",
  "intro": {
    "summary": "The Witch Lord is awake, and before the coming war he means to march his undead host on the King's army. The heroes must stop him, and the key is the Spirit Blade, the single weapon that can wound him. Dwarves of World End Mountain forged it and the elves of the Fountain of Leben tempered it, and it now rests in a ruined temple of great age. Find the blade and bring it to safety."
