      },
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "showText",
          "title": "Falling-block squares",
          "text": "On this map, the six marked falling-block squares follow a special rule. Whenever a hero steps onto one, roll 1 red die: a 4, 5 or 6 costs 1 Body Point, but with a helmet only a 6 does. Monsters ignore these squares. Leave the block tiles in the box; the squares never stop a hero from walking over them. Tap the marker on such a square each time a hero steps on it."
        }
      ]
    },
