          "type": "showText",
          "title": "Falling-block square",
          "text": "Roll 1 red die for the hero who stepped on this square. On a 4, 5 or 6 the hero loses 1 Body Point. A hero wearing a helmet loses it only on a 6. Nothing blocks the square."
        }
      ]
